    LLM: '1. Setup: prepare players, deck or tiles, and opening layout according to the variant. 2. Turn loop: each player performs one legal action (play, capture, build, bet, or pass/draw as applicable). 3. Resolution: each action updates control of tricks/cards/pot/layout. 4. End condition: when hand-ending criteria are met, scoring is computed and match state advances.',
    Player: '1. Setup: prepare players, deck or tiles, and opening layout according to the variant. 2. Turn loop: each player performs one legal action (play, capture, build, bet, or pass/draw as applicable). 3. Resolution: each action updates control of tricks/cards/pot/layout. 4. End condition: when hand-ending criteria are met, scoring is computed and match state advances.',
